Nox is the being whose body lies in the mines beneath [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Umbervale Hold|Umbervale Hold]] in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. Blood taken from the body, noxblood, is the source of [[Phenomena/Althane/Sanguis Noxa|vampirism]], and it is what Oreskian expeditions descend into the mines to find.
